WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.800
The example use case is answering support policy questions.

00:01.800 --> 00:07.000
Build a proof of concept that answers from a sample document.
The prototype needs further testing before deployment.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.100
Test answers, missing sources and restricted data.
The access check fails for restricted data.

00:11.100 --> 00:14.000
Enforce the permission boundary and rerun the tests.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Connect approved company data, user permissions and support tools.
Send uncertain answers to human review.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Deploy to a small group, then increase usage after review.
Keep the previous version available for rollback. This rollout is illustrative.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.300
Monitor answer quality, response speed and running costs.
A tool timeout is detected.

00:31.300 --> 00:35.000
Use the fallback and send the request to human review.
Add the timeout case to tests for the next release.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Blacksquare Labs: Senior engineering for AI projects.
Prototype development, evaluation, integration and ongoing maintenance.
